title: Clean_Room
---
<<set $Goblin = GetPartDisplayName("Goblin")>>
<<set $Wiki = GetPartDisplayName("Wiki")>>
<<set $Soldier = GetPartDisplayName("Soldier")>>
<<set $Lady = GetPartDisplayName("Lady")>>
<<set $Hiki = GetPartDisplayName("Hiki")>>

{$Goblin}: Oh man, the boss did some serious damage.
<<wait  2.0>>
{$Hiki}: Is that why there're takeout boxes everywhere?
<<wait  3.0>>
{$Goblin}: Huh? Oh, no. Those are normal 'round here! But look at that spot on the wall. That stain is new. I'd know.
<<wait  3.0>>
{$Goblin}: I've not seen the boss that angry since... well, we don't talk about it.
<<wait  3.0>>
{$Hiki}: Oh the room? Is the room our boss?
<<wait  3.0>>
{$Goblin}: ...
<<wait  3.0>>
{$Goblin}: You're serious, aren't you?
<<wait  3.0>>
{$Goblin}: The boss is the dipshit we all live inside of.
<<wait  2.0>>
{$Hiki}: We live inside a person? That's weird!
<<wait  2.0>>
{$Goblin}: ... You really were born a few minutes ago, huh?
===
